      "comment": "MR. THOMAS (6) is racing well without winning, recording five minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (30.21) over 525m at The Meadows. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Good form should continue. LAKEVIEW LYNETTE (7) was quickly out of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional and clocked 22.53 with a 1.75 lengths win at Warragul over 400m. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Leading chance again. EAGLE BREAD (1) ran below best last time finishing seventh (26.01) over 435m at this track from Box 4. Has won two of five starts from this draw. Likely to be about the money. AMRON SAMMY (3) hit the frame latest (25.98) when second at Warragul in a Grade 4/5. Has already won four times from this draw.",
